(l)
the allowances to be paid to the Chairperson and other members of the Board and any committee constituted by the
Academy;
(m)
the meetings of the Board, the Senate, or any committee, the quorum at such meetings and the procedure to be
followed in the conduct of their business;
(n)
any other matter which may be required or necessary for the purposes of this Act.
